"content\\\": \\\" A small room used for studying, reading or relaxing.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Laundry room\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A room where people wash and dry their clothes.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mysterious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing wonder or interest because it is unknown ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is being very mysterious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about rooms and objects.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mini ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " very small; tiny ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a mini-Michelangelo!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "splendid ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "excellent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The chest is splendid.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "chest", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large box used for storing things or clothes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This chest is amazing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "narrow ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " not wide; thin", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The streets